### Sandbox mock: autorisationId=10 — no subscribed services. Expect {"nbTotalServices": 0}.
POST {{ENEDIS_API}}/subscribed_services/v1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ENEDIS_TOKEN}}

{
  "comptage": false,
  "autorisationId": 10,
  "etatCode": ["ACTIF"],
  "serviceType": "ACCES"
}

